                <invention-title lang="de">KOMPONENTENTRÄGER MIT EINGEBETTETER KOMPONENTE MIT IN VERSCHIEDENEN VERDRAHTUNGSSCHICHTEN VERBUNDENEN PADS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SUPPORT DE COMPOSANT À COMPOSANT INTÉGRÉ AYANT DES PLAGES CONNECTÉES DANS DIFFÉRENTES COUCHES DE CÂBLAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">COMPONENT CARRIER WITH EMBEDDED COMPONENT HAVING PADS CONNECTED IN DIFFERENT WIRING LAYERS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A component carrier (100) which comprises a stack (102) comprising at least one electrically insulating layer structure (104) and a plurality of electrically conductive layer structures (106), and a component (108) embedded in the stack (102) and comprising an array of pads (110) on a main surface (112) of the component (108), wherein a first electrically conductive connection structure (114) of the electrically conductive layer structures (106) electrically connects a first pad (110a) of the pads (110) up to a first wiring plane (120), wherein a second electrically conductive connection structure (116) of the electrically conductive layer structures (106) electrically connects a second pad (110b) of the pads (110) up to a second wiring plane (122) being different from the first wiring plane (120), and wherein a third electrically conductive connection structure (118) of the electrically conductive layer structures (106) electrically connects a third pad (110c) of the pads (110) up to a third wiring plane (124) being different from the first wiring plane (120) and the second wiring plane (122).</p>
            </abstract>
